                                "sense_id": "0ca18792-21b4-3345-a353-80f64ef5af6f",
                                "text": "John Conley attested, That in the Lords Faulkland, Grandison and Chichester's times, the King's Rents werde collected by Horse-men, who laid upon them till they were paid."
